        },
        "subject": "LU-20860 doc: AGENTS: start from the current patchset",
        "message": "LU-20860 doc: AGENTS: start from the current patchset\n\nA change can get patchsets its author did not upload: Patch\nWatcher rebases a change checkpatch says cannot be cherry-picked,\nand reviewers rebase from Gerrit.  An agent that amends its local\ncommit of an older patchset and pushes it puts the change back on\nthe old base without a word from git.  Tell agents to fetch the\ncurrent patchset before amending a pushed patch.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I1f78276a21a0c1a6f65605559b2a6440563e686c\n"
      },
